    <title>【工体博弈论】EP1.首都夜生活放大镜：北派Player派对背后的情感博弈和游戏生态</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6888dcc8edf3fa32d51df18b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6888dcc8edf3fa32d51df18b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 15:15:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>B站搜索</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gZABebEzr/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0&amp;vd_source=6bfa399c3c962114fe1099f30caa9bc8" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gZABebEzr/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0&amp;vd_source=6bfa399c3c962114fe1099f30caa9bc8"><em><strong><span>Dirb电台</span></strong></em></a><span>观看视频播客</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjKskOXYuWCsF6aBnBcB5PLsMQO.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>主播/编导/后期：欧记桃</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期嘉宾：老大 李昂</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>主线贯穿灰暗的2022年的北京市，讲述了由5个95后北京孩子在非黑即白的首都大环境闯荡工体，玩儿转club夜生活的一个个彩色故事Drama。 主角团和大部分年轻人一样，在工体泡妞儿，玩儿名字，挥洒钞票，寻欢作乐，但在这个已经被大洗牌的新时代，主角团将老派player（北京老炮儿）坚守的规矩背在身上，在工体一路闯关一路进化直到自创了独一无二的生活方式——</span><em><strong><span>DirbStyle嘚儿派</span></strong></em><span>，感染同化着他们灵魂的fans。 因为</span><em><strong><span>5Dir Family</span></strong></em><span>有着发小这层关系，相互了解，配合默契，搭配着每个人独一无二的人格魅力+从不用A钱，让他们办的party成为无数年轻男女周末必回的家。而且Dirbis的拳头一致对外，也让无数无数鼠辈在散德行之前退避三舍。但在风口浪尖的他们，也会招来善于操控人心的小人混进组织内部试图瓦解主角团看似坚如磐石的友谊.... 在数不清的party的背后，A面是光鲜亮丽，亲兄热弟，男欢女爱，把酒言欢，B面是则明争暗斗，巧言令色，抢夺资源，笑里藏刀。所以剧本中会有如同爽剧般的情节，也会有真实如我们身边的人性阴暗面。 在5Dir family办的party上，出现过各种真假二代，某线小明星，东北pimp，创业者，rapper，佛爷，正的妞儿不正的鸡，留学生，黑人帮派，外来江湖。但，铁打的5Dir流水的席，主角团会和这些特色鲜明角色产生怎样的化学反应呢？ 欧导会带着老铁们探索工体宇宙，观赏人心博弈，代入主角团小伙子小姑娘们的爱恨情仇。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> </span><strong><span>工体宇宙故事梗概</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLcTONrG4gDiVO4QJ-up6Ro_iBK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvu5cBlCyot1N0nTn9-CGnD9qtNb.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 1号男主角-部队大院美区留子潘韦宝</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FooDumTQ7BzSBmaaSMIF96Y5a12j.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 1米9回回渣男贾亦协</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqwvYCRsX1u1_KJiopULUNtGE_4r.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 内蒙虎b大胡子李少德</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouAEEMU1fm8MBvHWVkaOBvhHaUO.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 金色寸头大脑袋高涵</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtFxuisxVSWMahRq5GespCx4IyHk.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> TMclub（2022工体最正的HipHop Club）</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAE8wqVXUjpuCnLyuc8MC2K-6yW.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 到达战场！</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3liK1xapqlgBKXeylblqaDLOUq.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk5mMR2g53c-uzDPlEkH0I7zgrHE.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> 潘韦宝贾亦协舞池打野天菜</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrUkpokgwBVTj6BuGTjr_2slvFVd.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-_9bicrDBXo_vSvXxLV4T0qnpW.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a> 打野成功班师回朝！</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2045">34:05</a> 贾亦协假意助力瘸腿少德</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">36:17</a> 超模人中龙Barry登场打闹潘韦宝</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOZBDl2sIRqAgJ578dYXFwbbEbJ.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 主角团集体搀扶瘸腿少德舞池蹦迪</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>B站搜索</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gZABebEzr/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0&amp;vd_source=6bfa399c3c962114fe1099f30caa9bc8" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gZABebEzr/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0&amp;vd_source=6bfa399c3c962114fe1099f30caa9bc8"><em><strong><span>Dirb电台</span></strong></em></a><span>观看视频播客</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltVCo0g9w2nYLRoVSTHIzyYxAEao.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmkew6m65zFgL5UBCY0be1lDqLrj.png"></figure>]]></description>
