    <guid isPermaLink="false">662c445a5fb33c1b2bd54f16</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Apr 2024 00:18:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>编导/主播：</span><em><strong><span>欧记桃</span></strong></em><span> |</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>&lt;小火车篇&gt;</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoLAwGxfMhmKHn-THros8E8cC747.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这世界上，到底有多少势不两立的友情与爱情？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“好看的皮囊千篇一律。”这句话确实很酷，可却很虚伪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>实话就是：千篇一律，你丫也爱！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>潘韦宝</span></strong></em><span>和</span><em><strong><span>李少德</span></strong></em><span>，</span><em><strong><span>白羊座</span></strong></em><span>和</span><em><strong><span>处女座</span></strong></em><span>。5Dir中的两个极端，相似环境下生长的完全不同的两个大男孩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>纵使两人从小一起长大，经历过的事儿一箩筐，也终究因为女孩子而被阿亮找到了蛋上的裂缝。</span></p><span></span><p><span>坚固的五边形，就此松动.......</span></p><span></span><p><span>欧记桃今天依旧站在编导视角，带乘客老铁们坐上这列小火车，观赏5Dir与音乐学院女主团的初次相遇。潘韦宝和李少德谁嬴谁输？大家买定离手了！</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 李少德洗浴中心偷溜天菜局，万宇飞成都火锅拆穿西洋镜</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> 初恋入场贾亦协放电接力沈嘉怡，高涵捕捉隔壁卡妞多鄙视主角团</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 阿亮驾驶美女小火车高调到站，小宝手拎整瓶龙舌兰上桌蹦迪</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a>酒喝精光高涵带头转场KTV，歌唱一半小吴忍受学姐PUA</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a>老江湖阿宝连招激怒青岛美女，女侠客孟爽性情连吹五扎野格</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a>误会解开潘韦宝孟爽以诚相待，恼羞成怒大魔王阿亮虎口夺食</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 黑暗密室宝哥怂成烂泥依旧强弩，重庆火锅孟爽确定心意潇洒示爱</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>视频节目请移步bilibili：Dirb电台</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0"><span>space.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0H5YMlGeQVXLoEBS_3pAvPW1pY.png"></figure>]]></description>
