    <title>【4下】月老化身碟仙牵红绳？五指山下的爱恋RIP</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66298098015b97ee464a4f85</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66298098015b97ee464a4f85</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 21:58:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>编导/主播：</span><em><strong><span>欧记桃</span></strong></em><span>|</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>&lt;情感特别篇&gt;下</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMOyG8gC8zkfHoMpO2skgulvsgX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>成年人的爱情，会面临怎样的挑战呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“和要走的他擦出了火花，又不甘心做朋友。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“怯懦的人会逃跑。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“天生一对，但被强大的手揉个粉碎。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“不在同一个频道的争吵，大打出手......”</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>时间线：2018-2022</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>随着潘韦宝独有的Dirbstyle AKA松弛感的回归，更危险的杀手回到了战场，谈了一圈正经恋爱作为进修，潘韦宝给女孩子带来的玩伴感更有杀伤力了.......</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着时间的进展，逐步成长的宝哥也原来越接近如今的我们，坠向时代的缩影。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欧导会带大家回看飞快的前几年，品味渣女杀手3.0在逐步走向社会产品线的VLOG。</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 杀手潘回归派对结识双胞胎姐妹，真善美错付昼夜颠倒异地无疾而终</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>双胞胎姐妹33&amp;风风</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVeSidcZLN7g9_aYIECktNWqsv9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>小滑梯擦出暧昧火花</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FigxoJzxS_qgSWHNgbYMAiqFZsQt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>机场送别</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhELjya7phRUyCGdAfY3SrOl5VJy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>横跨太平洋的视频电话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrkLJsWvEo7RvyZN7CyqE7hAPb_z.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 洛杉矶景点搭讪出共同好友，清醒女怯懦玩消失抛弃瘸男</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小营天秤查查</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFGgeSLgMhujmDQbv3S3T9SckTi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>合拍情人节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHe-Gljuf-3eHED9KpY46uUIE7l.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>痛苦断腿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyCR_mrwa5Hh-Mx3KFozj_Dxbxt.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> 门口要烟竟然要出个名门千金，谈情说爱差点谈出个家族罪人</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>任盈盈门口发薯条</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2RTQK1GerTHW6BYMWx9z3VjaBi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>任我行</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsSp2mac3pzeD8VRhEpWrVLrlYLw.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a> 认清现实低谷期再遇妹妹被治愈，逃避问题打工人点炸暴龙遭暴打</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>重庆双子-路路</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiuLmX_MWHphzZ8oAH0eqOZB8vHu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>视频节目请移步bilibili：Dirb电台</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0"><span>space.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0H5YMlGeQVXLoEBS_3pAvPW1pY.png"></figure>]]></description>
