    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>编导/主播：</span><em><strong><span>欧记桃</span></strong></em><span>|</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>&lt;情感特别篇&gt;中</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrugLfVVH1gnSTetx4Z_Wa0Pzrw9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>青春期的很多行为都可以被理解为，对这个未知世界的好奇尝试-至于什么行为，基于胆儿大胆儿小。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我爱你，你不爱我，我找个别人气气你。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我不爱你，你爱我，我予取予求。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我不爱你，你不爱我，我招完你我就跑。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我爱你，你爱我，我作死你......”</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>时间线：2011-2018</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>今天带来的四位女主，性格鲜明，各不相同，在她们的影响下，潘韦宝这块香香弹弹的橡皮泥会被捏成啥形状？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欧记桃会带大家穿越回变天的那几年，咀嚼4段或青涩或刺激的青春期恋情！翻一翻渣女杀手进化日记！</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 风风火火校园高调姐弟恋，花花草草社会初尝夜生活</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>昌平巨蟹-林佳璇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmm4rHCB6rqaYWir2Jlff-gEgqzC.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpyREWCC72r6NnbZAPLfyxsHH9y5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>社会人聚会，宝哥逐渐江湖化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkzdv_hovZhN2CkEErIe4mnJkL5C.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 甩初恋又反悔宝哥犯浑终被拒，写情书被发现阿豪偷天又换日</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>犯浑求和好，昌平巨蟹冷嘲热讽</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmUYQwzYP2I-9yoP9Hq7PNLwFCHP.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlFjkMZE2BSiFJoXkMQ8Cn49Gzev.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEi2hCBYgd-Qv6c92nZP36k5g1T.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>心碎之夜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmKFfsLRdkw_e0QNcCbvQXKMvDeZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 混江湖小大哥见天招蜂引蝶，惹学姐小幺儿一秒兴致全无</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>丰台天蝎-武艺璇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjyfSTBTcTA1vzZYvD-G6hFKdmdj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>小卖部搭讪丰台天蝎</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgPuUHyAIgfcMAfPqTWK5PuQ6hj7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>宝哥下头玩儿消失</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsL3ZDyqxzJP26ENFzeMNwJj0Bhc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>毕业季</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk0dAVY5in_YTlmBDEovbjlFaueH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv281dPz8cyTK4rgTx8A9afCZZsp.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 新学校宝哥装x花式操作泡前桌，赢赌约就翻脸变形记男友出手拯救</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>朝阳狮子-金棋缘</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsZTSsEHXK7uEWybt-Tn78hOu53I.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgljqf2GWsScswJ2EtJAQzmjA1Da.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>巧递旺仔牛奶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr2x1niMf1HrB0N5_tt21XTtvQ1g.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>戏耍大只</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqOLWmJGZT4JUS9AcRM6JZUxh_Mc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>楼道唱歌</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fih1ZmXbM_5Ecne8GYtvxPpEOGz3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>宿舍楼下丑拒逃跑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoK-gIbWcNVnSdnxFA99nXtf9bU-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>姚政出现剑指宝哥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqOtZ0BPmxCX4pV-R7zq-8lIwcam.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/livuycCCX8IpzSyUFs48231XPTqu.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 种瓜得瓜宝哥出国即坠入爱河，难舍难分薇拉占有欲杀死恋情</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>滨海天蝎-薇拉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNCIZ_cCfZKtH5spHYGbigK0xJ1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>机场送别</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmnTO5nP6pZvfNAGpIVzJWsG8Ycg.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrJSRB-Uy1z4DulufSpr3DWccTwM.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Vera初相识</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fix4vewO4IIe8ZIFcHxb3_TurjYs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>误会引发甲亢战争</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgHaaKWsMdRN4Yk4_ScQWNEofuFt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>视频节目请移步bilibili：Dirb电台</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0"><span>space.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0H5YMlGeQVXLoEBS_3pAvPW1pY.png"></figure>]]></description>
