    <title>【4上】任谁都有的初恋，坏孩子与三好学生的情感纠葛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662617a0200abebe6e74dfa8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662617a0200abebe6e74dfa8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 07:54:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播/编导：</span><em><strong><span>欧记桃</span></strong></em><span> |</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>&lt;情感特别篇&gt;上</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjtErdd6SOwx_LRFy-nu2BsCNugA.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>初恋</span></strong></em><span>，通常伴随着青春，也通常伴随着遗憾与一地狗血，能与初恋携手走向婚姻殿堂的少之又少。原因也很简单，因为我们在那个三观还未形成的年纪，匹配到时候结婚生子的那个他/她的几率很低。也是因为这个原因，初恋对我们的感情观的影响非常非常大，或许就是人生胜负手。</span></p><span></span><p><span>既然要单练潘韦宝的drama，当然要从爱之初体验讲起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>千默篇中，我们讲过能够摧毁PUA的人，一定是被PUA摧残过的人。2022主线中，酷酷的/不吝不吝的宝哥，11年前，也曾是个小舔狗吗？怎么舔呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欧记桃会带大家穿越回校园时代，从监控摄像头里看坏孩子和三好学生之间的情感大戏！</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 坏小子一见钟情昌平射手，三好生冰冷无视小宝情真</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtN3NkWXIJ_oC8H8qoNQPzOJbfpI.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlC1UO8PNtRQw80Mg729WwZwuYVZ.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 外冷内热暑假二人低调约会，反将一军宝哥耍招扳回一城</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>电影院</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvBcbWkuhngM5CVDa1PIMd_-TfOE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>诀别书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtI-Gbf0sIOn4NTGYZ9wYqO-1FzW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>QQ斗法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkRQw1xP7D_r92FPB23M34LG3t1w.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a> 吉他学成初代5der校园组乐队，别有用心文娱部长舞室打官腔</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>留头发啦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhMY1vw3uLSsTWN7w9y1NIMmnFsl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>部长嘴脸</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJgu9FIm8wGtXe2mxwUthjz13Dv.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 5der文艺大赛惜败未来女团idol，三人厕所门口偶遇宝哥愤然离场</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【雏菊】才艺大赛</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEgCeVw4jujsG2kK4GPMgXUTU8g.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>宝哥乐队【老男孩】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lm8IVJlEfbN5Y5QhCeicfYh7XSXh.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>R&amp;B女歌手【我爱的人】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqqE-6BY8eoBixrP2ncRi5eUT5wV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>楼道相遇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPK9XPLOFx2Q8Gd_2CZtkzpEy8E.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a> 美女学姐后台搭讪5der拍下经典旧照，昌平射手舌灿莲花宝哥犯驴终留遗憾</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>昌平巨蟹初相识，学姐照相ing</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt7WDaLovcRmTIzsLFS37y-3_zxe.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>经典留影</span></p><span></span><p><span>决裂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FotJYvNINxFqnj05hbGw0fXAqZVE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>视频节目请移步bilibili：Dirb电台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" href="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0">space.bilibili.com</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0H5YMlGeQVXLoEBS_3pAvPW1pY.png"></figure>]]></description>
