    <title>【3】感知能量-聚集能量，京城迷你三代成立新门派</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662364c0200abebe6e124a9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662364c0200abebe6e124a9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Apr 2024 06:46:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>编导/主播：</span><em><strong><span>欧记桃</span></strong></em><span> |</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>&lt;6S篇&gt;</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm33W2CIEtPDaXFwS3G0ALwm4pIi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Dir</span></strong></em><span>，一个打不出来的字，一个北方俚语，我们通常会在它后边加一个b</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Dirb</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>我们每天在职场，在公共场合，在朋友圈戴着面具，是为什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是为了体面的生活，因为我们的硬实力还不足以我们不伪装，还没有赚到支撑任性和足以我行我素的米。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以我们憋着，我们紧绷，我们一直在努力的扛着以保证前半辈子的心血不会付之东流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但这一切的一切，包括成功，不也只是为了自己可以有更多时间都拥有像在家一样的松弛感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在家都是</span><em><strong><span>Dirb</span></strong></em><span>，我们</span><em><strong><span>松弛</span></strong></em><span>，那我们何不在这条路上就松弛些，</span><em><strong><span>Dirb</span></strong></em><span>些呢？这样看，人生的终极目标不也就是</span><em><strong><span>Dirb</span></strong></em><span>吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欧记桃深深的为这些还在泥泞中挣扎不肯放下的人而着急，何不降低压迫自己的强度，拥抱你自己，拥抱你最松弛的状态， keep your </span><em><strong><span>Dirbstyle！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 贾亦协组织众人局前闯密室，恐怖黑屋子有人社牛有人怂</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小王</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmR1x2-Je7XcRHQzPROP9Enl8bWe.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrisGa_QfzhPaG0AuKRxPe2YEq8z.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVg2gzv_0iW462vpfSAlHjeew6C.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 万宇飞热场主角团到卡即顶点，大魔王阿亮登场拉圈儿挑衅小阿潘</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>到达战场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvsTwVB7Je0B-MllV7-Kue-zrYsn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿亮</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhnm2aG72psQXqGJotAzmquVE77w.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卢迪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXnZN_-WwFlMXQI365fQ2v_k_5i.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>coco</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7OBfbgyGlrgbcfI4ZWgwUAo_6g.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿亮挑衅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqOHLQM0KGxsZ_8KIaL70Ev_esIp.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> 潘韦宝醉酒中二登高漂移法拉利，贾亦协偶遇千千薄情漠视情人伤</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>老大漂移skrrrrr</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFgI38WYJ57grbeavKLOpVR3blf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>乐乐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnray-yjItp20R5bzh-hB2lQlFU4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>贾哥薄情</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsClY6LWfmeVh7fAD1os_Exol_D-.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> &nbsp;万宇飞猛拖三美女回房小吴吐八次，犬齿女乐乐醉酒咬破潘韦宝贾亦协</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>老万拖三美女回酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMCeVwzgc91plB2ubxpD2x9u87G.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtwzV9NyL25QMs4gjqnL29Yqdn66.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fky_5l0WFHIQojbuAS5tD74SYNzX.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">36:25</a> &nbsp;高涵提议阿宝为主角团冠以新名号，青龙套取香槟一人一口庆祝5Der诞生</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>5Der起名</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhWnnoNKmF3O8FNWyW5tXMtJtyBz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>开青龙套庆祝5Der诞生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLn_Q7n-7yc8RS1wouPHyBANnUw.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 李少德推脱情义酒消失于人海，潘韦宝助力少德结束生涯0-7</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>拒绝香槟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgof2nl6rsYvqaqewlw6ftaaPYWl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>代驾师傅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPyldJiYE_iPXewi87lLqeQtTTR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>视频节目请移步bilibili：Dirb电台</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0"><span>space.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0H5YMlGeQVXLoEBS_3pAvPW1pY.png"></figure>]]></description>
