  <item>
    <title>【2】北京oldschool精神小伙被骑射？面对家暴需得以暴制暴</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6620846f5dae7932c63a47bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6620846f5dae7932c63a47bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 02:24:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>编导/主播：</span><em><strong><span>欧记桃 </span></strong></em><span>|</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>&lt;千默篇&gt;</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmj7nk-WCFGQHIdOLJNvvjTnNtWp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小时候的大家都很想长大把？每当被老师训，被家长屌，被江湖人欺负，被海王戏耍.......</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么长大之后</span></p><span></span><p><span>究竟是哪儿变好了呢？发现社会上没有人像老师一样教你办事儿，发现父母随着变老越来越力不从心，发现进入职场后才意识到最狠的从来不是江湖人，发现曾经的那个她/他，原来是那么单纯......</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>潘韦宝</span></strong></em><span>，一个和各位有着不一样的童年经历，但同样烦恼的初生牛犊，内耗的样子是否和在座的你们一样呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>江湖，一个已经离我们逐渐远去的时代产物，无论是艺术创作，如90年代末的古惑仔，2000年初的征服。还是真实生活在我们身边的：大流氓，刀枪炮，矮骡子，土超哥。都已然淡出了今天这个正能量的时代，但一旦回想起当年混你们家那片的社会人的名字，不同的人还是会有不一样的感触把？是受过恩惠，还是被切过钱，劫过道，又或是被连哄带骗的去200无限畅饮的ktv陪大哥喝酒？</span></p><span></span><p><span>再说说PUA，欧记桃相信没有任何人敢吹牛b说他这辈子都没被PUA过，因为我们儒家文化的逻辑就是由PUA注入到你们的意识里的。能够通过自身强大的内心瓦解PUA的人，一定也经历过比其他人更加猛烈的PUA，正是因为遭的多了，才更了解对方的施法套路，从而破局。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期欧导会带着老铁们继续探索工体宇宙，深扒活跃在工体party的斯德哥尔摩综合征患者的内心世界，代入到主角团小伙子小姑娘们处境，观赏每个人在这一场大戏中的临场选择。</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a>-宝妈断钱粮意图考验败家子，潘韦宝初入社会深陷职场PUA</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjE6gi4A-foVFqM88yK1YG229QuT.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a>-女发小登场四人飞盘局被拼场，东北虎技不如人嚣张开火主角团</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>大王</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAlpo5k-ixLqdNqOSxWXurGlIv0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>飞盘局 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIkG7rmrkzV30RlaxC5JSmUEbSx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FplY_5KZKe-jdctZk344IxDTa2-s.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>壮哥哥上强度 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnmM4hI7mx-YYlg8bALWN_kzEfI.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv4bWtvXpINSONUGXqGx5cSCdHuP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>少德独挡千军万马 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhzRaj0KeCc8OHDMJ3TZlfMyA_e8.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a>-大王拉架引出主角团江湖过往，主角团最后一块拼图融入生日局</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9547_NV_wZD8K7nUjGquKCsUel.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr7Oc7Czyd1QShEtttFt9sUG04X5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>到达战场 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxTTRAxKjkz5ntadJSdeOiayXPS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>最后一块拼图-万宇飞 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luFv1SrBESvEt534uglGfVEhZ8zJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiq_sw2fmUP0AGHOQoe4Us8mXhYc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>小吴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgH3NFY6WwvXQSGdK67ljyqeUgqE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>12点整寿星贾哥携千默到场 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmZxQy8_MW8gU5tLhZyrNCmnam9R.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>生日局合体拼酒局 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmf_hcb-MfWYRhZ_YOQkuQ3UkoEO.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a>-千默遇事离席引发主角团猜想，大王小吴社牛打野TM服务生</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>千默看手机后光速离席</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspExDs2ZnN-f0v2BASGY2M5V7s5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大王锁定目标出征打野服务生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FicOSlWYZs6POONDXSO8wxZCS6dr.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAwq9CS66gY7Q4DHKW1Onvdg033.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a> </span></em><em><strong><span>DJ台黑哥们配合默契打大龙，洗手间主角团巧遇飞盘东北虎</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>DJ台打大龙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpoCM9P5xHxu7aW3jQNeHmTUh4j.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>香槟灌溉李少德</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQ3lDOgTnSf2M6Q_Qq-cfLIHEWk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>揭秘默罕默德PUA往事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiM8guuKQaQQxYGWBAWa8IQ7eIbf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>洗手间门口开大会</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokLThfm2Sz72u_VJFzprS6p-iz0.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a> 高涵负气清醒说服众人少管闲事，贾哥拱火成功唤醒阿宝内心猛兽</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>高涵开会</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnR5eD3_d1uAjRYS3PDuqKJjkLMk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>冰糖葫芦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0591DKyK4sTMrM237p7yvgeyId.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>高调拜拜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxAVi3MuA2QQnvE8jmxsD1O8q3L.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>飞起来了Ending</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn1PSV0DqYC57LQEa3I9nhxx3iQj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>视频节目请移步bilibili：Dirb电台</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0"><span>space.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0H5YMlGeQVXLoEBS_3pAvPW1pY.png"></figure>]]></description>
