  <item>
    <title>【1】Players夜生活放大镜？北派“玩家”十年重聚工体club</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661f30c748c40e2fb0cf2e2e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661f30c748c40e2fb0cf2e2e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Apr 2024 02:15:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>编导/主播：</span><em><strong><span>欧记桃</span></strong></em><em><span> </span></em><span>|</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>&lt;启航篇&gt;</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvgMBJ-KqLtJCTvO4woxau-S5xUj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>北京</span></strong></em><span>——中国的政治中心/北方的经济重心</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>工体</span></strong></em><span>——北京的娱乐中心</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>90后主角团</span></strong></em><span>——见证老时代与玩转新时代的一代，承上启下的一代。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>这三个关键词组成我们第一季的故事基底</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span>主线贯穿2022年-2023年，讲述了由5个90后北京孩子闯荡工体，玩儿转club夜生活的一个个故事Drama。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主角团和大部分年轻人一样，在工体泡妞儿，玩儿名字，挥洒钞票，寻欢作乐，但在这个已经被大洗牌的新时代，主角团将老派</span><em><strong><span>player</span></strong></em><span>（北京老炮儿）坚守的规矩背在身上，在工体一路闯关一路进化直到自创了独一无二的生活方式——</span><em><strong><span>Dirbstyle德尔比式</span></strong></em><span>，感染同化着他们灵魂的fans。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为5Dir Family有着发小这层关系，相互了解，配合默契，搭配着每个人独一无二的人格魅力+从不用A钱，让他们办的party成为无数年轻男女周末必回的家。而且derbs的拳头一致对外，也让无数无数鼠辈在散德行之前退避三舍。但在风口浪尖的他们，也会招来善于操控人心的小人混进组织内部试图瓦解主角团看似坚如磐石的友谊....</span></p><span></span><p><span>在数不清的party的背后，A面是光鲜亮丽，亲兄热弟，男欢女爱，把酒言欢，B面是则明争暗斗，巧言令色，抢夺资源，笑里藏刀。所以剧本中会有如同爽剧般的情节，也会有真实如我们身边的人性阴暗面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在5Dir family办的party上，出现过各种真假二代，某线小明星，东北pimp，创业者，rapper，佛爷，正的妞儿不正的鸡，留学生，黑人帮派，外来江湖。但，铁打的5der流水的席，主角团会和这些特色鲜明角色产生怎样的化学反应呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欧导会带着老铁们探索工体宇宙，观赏人心博弈，代入主角团小伙子小姑娘们的爱恨情仇。</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>-主角团5der人物背景关系介绍</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>潘韦宝</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjx4cuW3wsHDgOf2d-F2He4ZuaBB.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a>-潘韦宝组局满月楼，主角团时隔多年重聚涮羊肉</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>贾亦协 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq7C6kvQUE40x4INrMiZj0j7VwyI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>李少德 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUZECadXzIp2QqeryrwUC_0vwpW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>高涵 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh5PpRkjrNNoLawe3GMEpSZaGlnN.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a>-主角团5der首次合体征战工体，潘韦宝贾亦协出征舞池打野天菜</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>到达战场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiZL_K2VDMUGzgnqD1pgwajhwcq0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>出征舞池打野ing <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiUpYGrRptlBOkaErh3zPByE6zxf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>千默回眸<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">26:17</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuRuIg6ze22TGJiRRE0HmEOdPJVs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>默罕默德</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjAlPfKrldV6Ya_YohxqZxdauC0P.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>千千</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRm59C_LoAPXIx0VOBzWiNSvek8.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a>-千默卡座醉酒配对成功，高涵默罕默德初见擦火花</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>高涵天降<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhuInYIHAVt3z-H6Uyp1T0DZLUoQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>默罕默德心生情愫<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCeVhnPSGxf289eis5kC_DINIKp.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a>-贾亦协假意让妞给兄弟，潘韦宝性情戏逗人中龙</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>千千小拳拳锤大臂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOhq_78JNeCgq8Q8KLGwS9VVS6Y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>人中龙模特步入场 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">36:14</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fie-XznwHu6gjZGkqcaWzIqd_PQ8.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRH5BWJsMqI8c3fOr7yL-duJhpJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FocRJZGgmNkRhYwZT-opFB2EHYXC.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2374">39:34</a>-李少德孤寡面对3男三女，主角团架少德舞池单腿蹦迪</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>单腿蹦<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a></span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYhS1FVG8yv9Nee527szBvNSsyR.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqvnhaR3eYqsdKRNMluAkEr1L4Oo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Happyending无一人阵亡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FttZPcphePvpeqrTS53JjBbt6YV6.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>视频节目请移步bilibili：Dirb电台</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1937250944?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0"><span>space.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0H5YMlGeQVXLoEBS_3pAvPW1pY.png"></figure>]]></description>
